      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "You are caught between two realities\u2014one a vibrant utopia of creativity,
    the other a cold, mechanical dystopia.\n\nBoth worlds exist in parallel, yet
    an unstable force is pulling them together, threatening total collapse. As time
    passes, the Machine World corrupts the Happy World, draining its life.\n\nThe
    mirror can help you. The mirror is what connects the happy world to the corrupted
    world, allowing you to see more than you originally could.\n\nTo stop the Parallel
    Collapse, you must shift between dimensions, uncover hidden truths, and piece
    together the key to unlocking the Convergence Gate\u2014the only way to restore
    balance before both worlds vanish into nothingness.\n\nCan you stop the Parallel
    Collapse?"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
